==================

The object *note SchurRingElement: SchurRingElement, is a *note type:
(Macaulay2Doc)Type,, with ancestor classes *note RingElement:
(Macaulay2Doc)RingElement, < *note BasicList: (Macaulay2Doc)BasicList, < *note
Thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,.

